				"latex": "\\delta_O(x,y):=\\mu_O(x\\oplus y)",
				"interpretation": "The effective distinction is now explicitly grounded in the sole primitive. No independent metric is introduced. Observer dependence enters through \\(\\mu_O\\), while operational resolution is subsequently determined by \\(I_N(O)\\)."
